OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque honours Tyne and Wear Metro
OL,4,Apioneer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plaque has been unveiled to
OL,7,Fcommemorate a pioneer who played a
OL,8,Fpivotal role in turning the Tyne and
OL,9,FWear Metro from an idea into a reality.
OL,11,FProfessor Tony Ridley, who died in
OL,12,FMarch at the age of 92, was director
OL,13,Fgeneral of the Tyne and Wear Passenger
OL,14,FTransport Executive, now known as
OL,15,FNexus, from 1968 to 1975, and oversaw
OL,16,Fthe planning process, the award of
OL,17,Ffunding, and the first year of
OL,18,Fconstruction work.
OL,20,FNexus said without his leadership,
OL,21,Fskill and determination the light rail
OL,22,Fsystem may never have come to fruition.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
